[[File:map010.png|center|350px]]
'''Swimming Cats''' (猫ども海を渡る, ''Neko-domo Umiwowataru'', '''Cats Crossing the Sea''') is the 4th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 2nd sub-chapter of Stories of Legend and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Easy in terms of difficulty. The first stage, [[Premature Launch]] (an annoying level with 2 [[Master A.|Master As]]), is ironically the hardest.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces two new enemies:
*[[Duche]]: A somewhat slow-moving enemy with decent attack and health. Has a quick attack rate and hits two times per animation. Overall, well-rounded in terms of stats.
*[[THE SLOTH]]: A slow-moving enemy with high health and attack power, but a slow attack rate. Can stall your cats for a very long time. Similar to [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]].

